      "title": "Mechanism",
      "body": "HTDA_and_BDC_ligand_incorporation_into_metallophosphite_structure → stability"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] introduce phosphite oxyanions together with rigid BDC linkers, soft metal ions, and triazole ligands → enables formation of mixed-ligand terephthalate-metallophosphite frameworks without organic templates or space-filling counterions"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] incorporate 1H-1,2,4-triazole-3,5-diamine (HTDA) and 1,4-benzenedicarboxylate (BDC) ligands into metallophosphite structures → yields a new class of frameworks reported to have high framework stabilities"
    },
    {
      "title": "Comparison",
      "body": "Hg2+ vs Cd2+: winner=subject_a on adsorption_by_the_title_compound_from_aqueous_mixture"
    }
