  "notable_quotes": [
    "Incorporating HTDA and BDC into metallophosphite structures is presented as a design route to high framework stability in NTOU-4 and NTOU-4a.",
    "Framework stability differs between the isostructural zinc and cobalt analogues, indicating metal identity affects robustness.",
    "The zinc compound shows high stability: up to 400 °C in air and resistance to seawater, pH 3-11 aqueous media, and boiling organic solvents."
